    "title": "Woman killed in head-on crash on State Road 9 in Grant County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WOWO News ,\n2 days ago\nGRANT COUNTY, Ind. (WOWO) — A woman was killed in a two-vehicle head-on crash north of Marion Tuesday night, according to the Grant County Sheriff’s Office. Deputies were dispatched around 8:35 p.m. Nov. 3 to the 4300 block of North Huntington Road, also known as State Highway 9, after 911 calls reported a crash.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n3",
